      "markdown": "# 笔试部分(60 分)\n\n## 五、 判断下列单词画线部分的发音是(Y)否(N)相同。(5分)\n\n( ) 1.  $ \\underline{wh} $at  $ \\underline{wh} $o ( ) 2.  $ \\underline{wh} $ere  $ \\underline{wh} $ich\n\n( )3.  $ \\underline{wh} $en  $ \\underline{wh} $ose ( )4.  $ \\underline{wh} $ite  $ \\underline{w} $all\n\n## 六、 将下列短语与其对应的图片连线。(5 分)\n\n1. watch TV  2. clean the room  3. have an English class  4. drink water  5. draw pictures\n\nA.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_448_1488_764_1787.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"10%\" /></div>\n\n\nB.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_933_1544_1164_1854.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\nC.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1395_1544_1682_1822.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\nD.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1892_1614_2177_1807.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\nE.\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_2389_1536_2610_1814.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 七、 单项选择。(5分)\n\n( )1. —What are they doing?\n\n—_____\n\nA. They clean their rooms. B. He is eating. C. They are reading books.\n\n( )2. They are walking ___ a bridge.\n\nA. at B. in C. on\n\n( )4. Can you ___ music with me?\n\nA. to play B. playing C. play\n\n( )5. What are you _____?\n\nA. saying B. tells C. say\n\n## 八、 根据图片提示，补全对话。(10分)\n\n1. —What are the students doing?\n\n—___\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1647_3318_2008_3581.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"12%\" /></div>\n\n\n2. —What is Wang Jin doing?\n\n—\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1642_3641_1901_3902.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"8%\" /></div>\n",
